=== 3. THE LOOP'S GAIN, from the model's own structure ===
  NPP = npp0 [(1 - phi) + phi veg/veg0] f(CO2). At equilibrium veg ∝ NPP, so a
  sustained fertilisation factor f = 1 + e gives dNPP/NPP0 = e / (1 - phi):
  phi = 0.50  =>  the land's equilibrium CO2 response is x2.00 what fertilisation alone gives,
  and it builds on the vegetation timescale (tau_wood = 20 yr).
